From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 11:48:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] packages: colocate published Convex archives

Import the three immutable package archives and provenance manifests currently served by convex-in-prod.github.io. Keep source-SHA paths and bytes unchanged so the existing package URLs and lockfile integrity values remain valid.

Make convex-js the package source of truth and document the separate publication-commit boundary. The Pages repository can mirror this directory from an exact commit instead of owning binary package history.
